    <h2>How We Can Assist</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Explaining what to expect at each stage, from the moment you report your passport missing through to updating your Philippine immigration record</li>
      <li>Reviewing and preparing the required Philippine immigration documentation once your replacement travel document is issued, and coordinating it on your behalf</li>
      <li>Liaising with the Bureau of Immigration on your behalf, where representation is permitted</li>
      <li>Identifying whether the loss also affects related matters, such as your ACR I-Card, exit clearance requirements, or other documents tied to your stay, so nothing is missed</li>
      <li>Helping you avoid unnecessary delays to your onward travel or current stay</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="context-note">
